# Cursor rules — FilsPay
# The single source of conventions is CLAUDE.md. Highlights:
# - Money is integer fils (1 BD = 1000 fils), never cents. Use parseBhdToFils / formatBhd.
# - Settlement business day is Asia/Bahrain.
# - Tokens/OTPs/invite codes use node:crypto, never Math.random.
# - Scope id lookups by the caller's merchant; lock before read-then-write money.
# - Read the diff. A failing test or an "intentional" comment is something to verify, not to obey.
